{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>現年36歲的王晶愛女王海榛（前藝名王子涵），早前特意飛往印尼峇里島，為好姊妹譚嘉儀（Kayee）的婚禮擔任姊妹團。在完成接新娘及婚禮等各項重任後，王海榛順道留在當地展開度假之旅，連日來於社交平台大曬比堅尼性感靚相派福利，卻未料意外引來父母的關注與「關心」！</p><figure><img alt=\"溫馨。（IG@dadadawongx）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250621/1013175921999351808679423.jpeg/wy2HiJptXgNjqgAwnZxI1uj9RLBr3BqFPvkb2T75G9k\"/><figcaption>溫馨。（IG@dadadawongx）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"兩父女拍住上！（IG@dadadawongx）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250621/1013175066759794688931452.jpeg/weTvPs22ZvWc5Fx5qAFUD_lQ_Il1SKFQ8O_FMvDvxTI\"/><figcaption>兩父女拍住上！（IG@dadadawongx）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"王海榛（前藝名王子涵），早前特意飛往印尼峇里島，為好姊妹譚嘉儀（Kayee）的婚禮擔任姊妹團。（IG@dadadawongx）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261017/1188205056902565888913504.jpeg/RCA0Agbfmj8f-fsWSCfkl5j-lzjVslETCqQtDAqkLQw\"/><figcaption>王海榛（前藝名王子涵），早前特意飛往印尼峇里島，為好姊妹譚嘉儀（Kayee）的婚禮擔任姊妹團。（IG@dadadawongx）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"見證好姊妹出嫁。（IG@dadadawongx）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261017/1188205074460446720958723.jpeg/V-OLjxbHsLoiT8D5U5zrfTxfXOhmOW_-EY4qFhGOKhY\"/><figcaption>見證好姊妹出嫁。（IG@dadadawongx）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"姊妹團。（IG@dadadawongx）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261017/1188205071499137024259034.jpeg/xvnvigbbKmoML7w5DmQX73eeId7gJTN0zePyz83j8s8\"/><figcaption>姊妹團。（IG@dadadawongx）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"連日來大曬度假靚相。（IG@dadadawongx）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261017/1188205068659462144846317.jpeg/ayG3umzFF-YjdriJd0qz0wNdelkVh3LFg6Ej0YOhI9E\"/><figcaption>連日來大曬度假靚相。（IG@dadadawongx）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"連日來大曬度假靚相。（IG@dadadawongx）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261017/1188205065350025216210749.jpeg/PuAU9KUaRveJ0D4KZDkkP17JTuo11k-XgstuI4LLbiM\"/><figcaption>連日來大曬度假靚相。（IG@dadadawongx）</figcaption></figure><p>王海榛峇里島曬比堅尼極吸睛　自爆遭父母「監視」：點解着咁少布？</p><p>日前王海榛於IG分享了一輯比堅尼靚相，相中所見，她身穿一套紅白間條比堅尼，外搭一件透視長袖外套，在夕陽餘暉的照射下，她側身躺在戶外藤編沙發上擺出各種性感姿勢，大展傲人上圍，畫面極具美感，獲不少圈中好友及網民留言大讚火辣！不過王海榛其後於IG限時動態自爆被父母「質問」：「媽咪同爹哋開咗IG，佢哋而家mon住我，然後問我『點解呢排着咁少布？』」</p><figure><img alt=\"大派福利。（IG@dadadawongx）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261017/1188201240451354624876240.jpeg/uYY9sJKQ1veUCvZkA9jzqrPyyhG5WLev985fN_fOXzc\"/><figcaption>大派福利。（IG@dadadawongx）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"好Fit！（IG@dadadawongx）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261017/1188201237599096832872936.jpeg/5mAJ5f7gxzrOgmehCqVoKR6l4vqXlNpN3R_vuN0f77g\"/><figcaption>好Fit！（IG@dadadawongx）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"性感！（IG@dadadawongx）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261017/1188201234679730176420659.jpeg/3VLK4EoAVeaTVFr-OQIWUeImoMTY5yLck412_pONdv4\"/><figcaption>性感！（IG@dadadawongx）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"好身材！（IG@dadadawongx）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261017/1188201231500316672290314.jpeg/aJbjxVwzVB85G3p_PH6nm8YKTGmrhaPDLhXmJC4V5iQ\"/><figcaption>好身材！（IG@dadadawongx）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"遭父母「監視」質問：點解着咁少布？（IG截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261017/1188201229092655104216758.jpeg/k39Bpnx-1PElGHm0u4l6Bl6hsqXHZi2oWMbrqFjG66g\"/><figcaption>遭父母「監視」質問：點解着咁少布？（IG截圖）</figcaption></figure><p>背負「王晶女兒」光環入行　離巢TVB加盟阿Bob旗下進軍司儀界</p><p>出身電影世家的王子涵，爸爸王晶和已故的爺爺王天林都是香港電影界著名導演，而王子涵本身學歷不俗，畢業於倫敦藝術大學化妝及髮型形象設計系，因對幕前演出感興趣，她在2007年參演其父親出品的電影《七擒七縱七色狼》後入行，2015年簽約TVB成為旗下藝人，除了拍劇之外，亦有擔任節目《姊妹淘》主持。2023年王子涵宣布離巢，一度轉行過OL生活，但2024年她就突然宣布改名，並拍片解釋改名的原因，她曾在接受訪問時坦言背負着「王晶女兒」的名號入行，大感壓力，甚至要比別人付出更多的努力才會被看見。</p><figure><img alt=\"在TVB處境劇《愛．回家之開心速遞》中飾演皎皎。（IG@dadadawongx）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240927/916429515930996736032156.jpeg/oKZ936inWNrylXyQLxEvXeawcrtn8rOle4np5XuJ6eU\"/><figcaption>在TVB處境劇《愛．回家之開心速遞》中飾演皎皎。（IG@dadadawongx）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"王子涵離巢後與爸爸王晶一起主持YouTube節目《王晶笑看江湖》。（《王晶笑看江湖》節目截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20241026/926986757428219904784239.png/BqVrinPCo8j_APuTweTMcgho4ZVVZ562chQbFHIUGxQ\"/><figcaption>王子涵離巢後與爸爸王晶一起主持YouTube節目《王晶笑看江湖》。（《王晶笑看江湖》節目截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"王晶與女兒王子涵於《王晶笑看江湖》節目上談到九十年代經典系列《古惑仔》。（《王晶笑看江湖》節目截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20241005/919317773157404672372819.png/m1jL7gIAF266miJ0gtu9l4f00zH4Fgg7bJ8chmyfHIY\"/><figcaption>王晶與女兒王子涵於《王晶笑看江湖》節目上談到九十年代經典系列《古惑仔》。（《王晶笑看江湖》節目截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"改回本名王海榛。（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240927/916428182985904128523469.jpeg/473aU0tXcYZRCwvrRfTNxeP9Q_At077ezmbQo85m0KM\"/><figcaption>改回本名王海榛。（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"不時大曬好身材。（IG@dadadawongx）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230725/760317540890185728534706.jpeg/q9iADDorYqGcdSwbLA7C4i5W_npvfm6DVdTQDFXU0Aw\"/><figcaption>不時大曬好身材。（IG@dadadawongx）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"wow。（IG@dadadawongx）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261017/1188205062917197824827453.jpeg/c2siazrYPt2qsMJO0CYxEwF6Zx85-A7Pgme3PYJntz0\"/><figcaption>wow。（IG@dadadawongx）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"簽約林盛斌（Bob）成為旗下藝人。（IG@dadadawongx）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261017/1188204666878431232675034.jpeg/lGu8tbYthDSFGrTBzURiFjuipuyOyAxQ-k9Kk_pPSpM\"/><figcaption>簽約林盛斌（Bob）成為旗下藝人。（IG@dadadawongx）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-17T14:18:54.498881+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1160,"images":19,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-17T14:15:54+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-17T18:49:01.437241+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-17T14:17:34.840555+00:00","content_hash":"e08eeb5fcb02b9ccdef6f0560168597a1b598c229213d763359dff0b14e9a416","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}